    <item>
      <title>1.0.2</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:51:57 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Use your own AI provider. Connect your own account at one of nine providers, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, and rename on your own key. A new AI tab in Settings holds the setup, and a one-time lifetime licence is available in the app.</li>
          <li>On a nymos subscription, documents are now processed in the European Union.</li>
          <li>More formats, 57 in all: OpenDocument, Pages, Numbers and Keynote, plus audio and video named from the details the file carries.</li>
          <li>Batches cope with limits. Files your model cannot read are flagged before the run and skipped rather than failing it, and a rate limit now waits and resumes instead of ending the batch.</li>
          <li>A redrawn Settings window and new typefaces throughout the app.</li>
          <li>Fixes: a locked keychain no longer starts a fresh trial, Command-Q quits with a sheet open, and the status pill appears only while a run is actually happening.</li>
        </ul>
      
      ]]></description>
